"Field incident (2026-08-15): a live deploy of the offered-move commit trapped players - movement now requires the path's OFFER, but the deployment's already-generated world predates offers (its path entities have no offered_actions rows), and the prod asset push was itself refused (quick_move/divine_heal removed from the pack; pushes never drop assets implicitly). Pre-alpha remedy: deployments after asset-shape changes need a FRESH database (publish + push + regenerate). This task is the durable fix: explicit removal operations plus migration of stored rows on re-push - including REGENERATING or patching world entities instantiated from updated blobs."